Package: surveyBurden
Title: Measuring the Response Burden of Web Surveys
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Peter", "King", , "p.king1@leeds.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8550-466X"))
Description: Measures the objective burden of a survey, the work it asks of
    respondents. Each question is scored with the GfS+ point scheme, which
    extends the response burden points of Heimgartner and Axhausen (2024)
    <doi:10.32866/001c.125481>. The package follows a survey's routing and
    display logic to give the burden along each route before fieldwork, and
    reconstructs the burden shown to each respondent from response data
    after fieldwork. It reads 'Qualtrics' surveys (.qsf export or API) and
    also scores a table of questions from any platform.
